---
layout: layouts/base.njk
htmlLang: en
ogLocale: en_US
title: Costumes — Luxury Cover Band
description: "20+ stage looks by Luxury Cover Band: red, black glitter, gold, white and themed stage costumes for weddings, corporate events and TV shoots."
keywords: "stage costumes cover band, Luxury Cover Band looks, red stage costumes, white stage costumes"
permalink: /en/costumes/
---

<section class="page-hero page-hero--list">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<p class="page-hero__breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/en/' | url }}">{{ site.shortName }}</a> <span>·</span><span>Costumes</span></p>
		<p class="page-hero__eyebrow">Stage looks</p>
		<h1 class="page-hero__title">One band.<br><span class="muted">Many visual moods.</span></h1>
		<p class="page-hero__lead">Every costume set is a complete visual story for weddings, corporate events, private parties, TV shoots and themed shows.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--flush">
	<ul class="ig-grid">
		{% for c in enContent.costumes %}
		<li class="ig-tile">
			<a class="ig-tile__link" href="{{ ('/assets/costumes/' + c.slug + '.jpg') | url }}" data-lightbox>
				<img src="{{ ('/assets/costumes/' + c.slug + '.jpg') | url }}" alt="{{ c.title }} — Luxury Cover Band stage look" title="{{ c.title }} — Luxury Cover Band stage look" loading="{{ 'eager' if c.priority else 'lazy' }}"{% if c.priority %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>
				<span class="ig-tile__caption">{{ c.title }}</span>
			</a>
		</li>
		{% endfor %}
	</ul>
</section>
